  <h3>Compress, encode, diagnose: PCA-enhanced quantum neural networks for breast cancer classification</h3>
  <p class="meta"><span class="venue">IEEE RASSE 2025, Singapore</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Prajapati, Saha, Ahsan, Aswath Babu H</p>
  <figure class="fig" data-fig>
    {% include "figures/qnn.svg" %}
    <figcaption>Thirty measurements are compressed to five principal components, one rotation angle per qubit, and a small classical network turns the five qubit readouts into the diagnosis. Classical compression is what buys usable quantum capacity on a five qubit register.</figcaption>
